# The people around: a traveller standing near, gossip, news, quarrels, friends, family, the day and the weather.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- A traveller nearby

scene pl_stranger
when topic=player topic.known=no
a[child] : Look! Who's that? | Is that a traveller? Ask them where they're from!
a[guard] : Keep an eye on #topic.subject#. I don't know that face.
a[merchant] : #topic.subject# looks like they've coin to spend.
a : Who's #topic.subject#, do you know? | Never seen #topic.subject# before. | #topic.subject#. Not from round here.
b[old] : Travellers. Always looking, never buying.
b[guard] : Probably just passing through.
b : No idea. | Don't stare. | Passing through, I'd guess.
a : Hm. | I'm not staring. | Probably.

scene pl_known
when topic=player topic.known=yes
a : There's #topic.subject# again. | #topic.subject#'s back, I see. | Isn't that #topic.subject#?
b[merchant] : Good. #topic.subject# pays fair.
b[guard] : Hm. I'm watching that one.
b : So it is. | Seems to like it here. | Hello to them.
a : It is. | Seems so. | Indeed.

scene pl_stranger_whisper
when topic=player topic.known=no pair.band=friends|family
a : Don't look now, but #topic.subject# is listening. | Talk quieter. #topic.subject# can hear us. | #topic.subject# has big ears, I bet.
b : Let them listen. | Oh. Right. | Ha. Most travellers do.
a : Fine. | Exactly. | Ha.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gossip

scene gs_heard
when topic=gossip
a : Have you heard? They say #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Word is #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | I heard something about #topic.subject#. That #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b[old] : People say all sorts. I'll believe it when I see it.
b[guard] : Is that so? I'll remember that.
b[child] : Really? Really really?
b : #topic.subject#? I'd not have thought it. | Who told you that? | No!
a : That's what I heard. | Never you mind. | It's true, I'd wager.

scene gs_secret
when topic=gossip pair.band=friends|family|spouses
a : Between us, #b.name#: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | Don't tell a soul, but #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | You'll keep this to yourself? #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : I won't say a word. | Truly? | You're making that up.
a : Good. | Truly. | I'm not!

scene gs_rival
when topic=gossip pair.band=rivals
a : Even you should know this: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. | I suppose you'd want to hear: #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : And why would I believe you? | Spreading tales again?
a : Believe what you like. | Suit yourself.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- News of one's own

scene nw_marriage
when topic=news topic.kind=marriage
a : #topic.news#. Can you believe it? | You'll have heard: #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. I'm still getting used to it.
b : Congratulations! | I'm so glad for you. | About time!
a : Thank you. | So am I. | Ha. Everyone says that.

scene nw_loss
when topic=news topic.kind=loss
a : #topic.news#. | It's hard, #b.name#. #topic.news#. | I don't know how to say it. #topic.news#.
b[priest] : I'll keep them in my prayers. And you.
b : I'm so sorry. | If there's anything I can do... | That's terrible.
a : Thank you. | There isn't. But thank you. | It is.

scene nw_work
when topic=news topic.kind=work
a : #topic.news#. | Big change for me: #topic.news#. | Did I tell you? #topic.news#.
b : That's wonderful. | Good for you. | How is it so far?
a : We'll see. | Thank you. | Hard. But good.

scene nw_crime
when topic=news topic.kind=crime
a : #topic.news#. I'm still shaking. | Did you hear? #topic.news#. | #topic.news#. In broad daylight.
b[guard] : The watch knows. We'll see to it.
b : That's awful. | Are you all right? | Shameful.
a : I hope so. | I will be. | It is.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Old quarrels

scene qr_grudge
when topic=quarrel
a : You've a nerve showing your face here. | Still sulking about last time? | I've not forgotten what you did.
b : I go where I please. | Me? You started it. | Nor have I forgotten what you said.
a : Then go somewhere else. | I did not. | Good. Remember it.

scene qr_blame
when topic=quarrel
a : This is your doing, and you know it. | Everyone knows you can't be trusted. | Keep out of my way.
b : Prove it. | Everyone knows nothing of the sort. | Gladly.
a : I don't have to. | Ask anyone. | See that you do.

scene qr_cold
when topic=quarrel
a : #b.name#. | Oh. It's you. | Hm.
b : #a.name#. | Yes. Me. | Hm yourself.
a : Well. | Charming as ever. | ...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Friends

scene fr_easy
when topic=friends
a : There you are! | I was hoping I'd see you. | Sit with me a while.
b : Here I am. | And here I am. | Gladly.
a : How have you been? | I've missed you. | Good.
b : Better for seeing you. | Since yesterday? | Good company makes a good day.

scene fr_tease
when topic=friends
a : You've got straw in your fur again. | Still can't whistle, can you? | Did you lose another bet?
b : Where? Get it off! | I can whistle fine! | I'll win the next one.
a : Ha. There. | Prove it. | You never do.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The day

scene dy_market
when topic=day here.day=market
a : Market day. Everyone's out. | Stalls are full today. | Busy at the stalls.
b[merchant] : My best day. I hope.
b : I'm going for bread. | Good day for it. | Too busy for me.
a : Get there early. | It is. | Ha.

scene dy_rest
when topic=day here.day=rest
a : A quiet day, for once. | No work today. What to do with myself? | Restday. Bliss.
b[guard] : Not for me. Never a Restday for the watch.
b : Sleep, that's what I'll do. | Sit in the sun. | Enjoy it.
a : Sounds right. | Good plan. | I will.

scene dy_festival
when topic=day here.day=festival
a : Quite a feast for #here.festival#! | Have you had any of the cakes? | Music everywhere for #here.festival#.
b : Wonderful, isn't it? | Too many. | I've been dancing all morning.
a : It is. | Never too many. | Save me a dance.

scene dy_weather
when topic=day
a : Wet enough for you? | Filthy weather. | Can't see the end of the street for this.
b : Wet enough for fish. | Filthy. | I've seen worse.
a : Ha. | Indeed. | Have you?

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Family

scene fm_kids
when topic=family a.child
a : The little ones are growing like weeds. | Have you seen how tall our youngest is now? | The pups were up all night.
b[old] : They grow and then they're gone. Enjoy them.
b : They are. | Nearly as tall as me! | Again?
a : I do. | Nearly. | Again.

scene fm_chores
when topic=family pair.band=family|spouses
a : Whose turn is it to fetch water? | Did you mend the roof yet? | The woodpile's low.
b : Yours. | Tomorrow. | I'll split some tonight.
a : It was mine yesterday! | You said that last week. | Good.

scene fm_elder_care
when topic=family pair.band=family
a : How's Grandmother? | Father's cough is worse. | Mother keeps asking after you.
b : Stubborn as ever. | I'll bring something for it. | I'll visit tonight.
a : Good. | Please. | She'd like that.

scene fm_spouses_love
when topic=family pair.band=spouses
a : I'm glad I married you. Some days. | You're a good mate, #b.name#. | Come home early tonight.
b : Only some days? | So are you. | I'll try.
a : Most days. | Ha. | Do.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Weather

scene wt_rain
when topic=weather here.weather=rain|storm
a[farmer] : Rain at last. The fields needed it. | Too much rain. The roots will rot.
a[fisher] : No boats out in this.
a : Wet through. | Will it ever stop raining? | Look at that rain.
b[old] : My bones knew it was coming.
b[child] : Puddles! Can I jump in them?
b : Wet through myself. | It'll stop. Eventually. | Get inside.
a : Ha. | Eventually. | Right behind you.

scene wt_snow
when topic=weather here.weather=snow
a[child] : Snow! It's snowing! | Can we make a snow wolf?
a : Snow again. | My paws are freezing. | Look at it come down.
b[old] : Hard winter. I said it would be.
b : Keep moving; you'll stay warm. | Pretty, though. | I'd rather be by a fire.
a : Easy for you. | Pretty and cold. | Me too.

scene wt_fog
when topic=weather here.weather=fog
a : Can't see my own paws in this fog. | Fog's come in thick. | Who's that? Oh, it's you.
b[guard] : Easy for thieves, a fog like this.
b : Mind where you step. | It'll burn off by noon. | Just me.
a : I am. | Hope so. | Ha.

scene wt_clear_hot
when topic=weather here.season=summer here.weather=clear
a : Too hot to think. | Find some shade. | The well's low.
b : Too hot to work. | Good idea. | It'll rain soon.
a : Too hot for anything. | Under the tree, then. | Hope so.
